  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Here <math><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Hence, for <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;the system will not have a unique solution.</p><p>The sum of values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
